					"Data": "Third-party themes are stored in data/themes/ and icon packages in data/icons/; both participate in data sync and snapshots. Each device keeps its appearance selection in its local conf/conf.json. Built-in appearance resources are not synced. Upgrade migration moves the original directories into data and removes the source copies."
